 he never  ever missed an opportunity to educate  did you feel that was true too  based on your dealings with him oh  absolutely yes he  always was willing to explain why he was  doing what he was doing  and he was always willing to forgive he  forgave  george wallace the segregationist  governor of alabama  in the 60s who  who said on the steps of the capital  segregation now segregation forever  and john lewis forgave him among others  so he did practice no planets really  yes he did right up until the very end  it's good to see you bill plant at 27  and here we are in 2020. you look good  thank you so much for joining us  thank you reporter's notebook

